q
1 0 0 1 57.84 529.36 cm
q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 27.2 Tm /F1 8.8 Tf 12 TL (This manual explains how DocumentAI employees request technical support, troubleshoot common issues, and report) Tj T* (security incidents. It covers company-managed laptops, identity accounts, email, collaboration tools, approved business) Tj T* (applications, network access, and peripherals.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 57.84 487.36 cm
q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 27.2 Tm /F1 8.8 Tf 12 TL (IT Support is available Monday through Friday, 8:00 a.m. to 6:00 p.m. Pacific Time, excluding company holidays. Employees) Tj T* (should submit requests through the IT Support Portal at https://support.documentai.example. If the portal is unavailable,) Tj T* (email helpdesk@documentai.example. For suspected security incidents, use the urgent reporting procedure in Section 8.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 57.84 463.36 cm
q
.121569 .305882 .47451 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 3 Tm /F2 12 Tf 15 TL (2. Ticket priorities and response targets) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 57.84 421.36 cm
q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 27.2 Tm /F1 8.8 Tf 12 TL (Priority 1 - Critical: a confirmed security incident, company-wide outage, or outage preventing a critical business function for) Tj T* (most users. Target initial response: 30 minutes during support hours. IT Operations immediately assigns an incident lead and) Tj T* (provides updates at least every 60 minutes.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 57.84 391.36 cm
q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 15.2 Tm /F1 8.8 Tf 12 TL (Priority 2 - High: a major service failure affecting a team or several users with no reasonable workaround. Target initial) Tj T* (response: 4 business hours. IT Support provides updates at least once per business day.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 57.84 361.36 cm
q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 15.2 Tm /F1 8.8 Tf 12 TL -0.119576 Tw (Priority 3 - Normal: an individual user issue, standard access request, or non-critical application problem. Target initial response:) Tj T* 0 Tw (1 business day. Updates are provided when status changes or additional information is needed.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 57.84 319.36 cm
q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 27.2 Tm /F1 8.8 Tf 12 TL (Priority 4 - Request: routine software, equipment, or information requests that do not interrupt current work. Target initial) Tj T* (response: 3 business days. These targets are service goals, not guaranteed resolution times. A ticket should include the) Tj T* (affected service, business impact, start time, error message, device asset tag, and troubleshooting already attempted.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 57.84 295.36 cm
q
.121569 .305882 .47451 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 3 Tm /F2 12 Tf 15 TL (3. Account and sign-in troubleshooting) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 57.84 265.36 cm
q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 15.2 Tm /F1 8.8 Tf 12 TL -0.007543 Tw (Step 1: confirm the username format and check that Caps Lock is not enabled. Verify that the device has an internet connection) Tj T* 0 Tw (and that the system date and time are correct.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 57.84 235.36 cm
q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 15.2 Tm /F1 8.8 Tf 12 TL (Step 2: if multifactor authentication fails, check that the employee is using the registered method and has connectivity. Do not) Tj T* (approve an unexpected prompt. Never ask a user to share a one-time code or password.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 57.84 205.36 cm
q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 15.2 Tm /F1 8.8 Tf 12 TL (Step 3: if the account is locked, stop repeated attempts and submit a ticket. IT Support verifies identity using the approved) Tj T* (process before unlocking an account or resetting credentials.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 57.84 163.36 cm
q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 27.2 Tm /F1 8.8 Tf 12 TL (Step 4: if a password reset is required, use the official company password-reset page linked from the identity portal. IT Support) Tj T* (will never request a password by email or chat. Repeated unexpected MFA prompts should be treated as a possible) Tj T* (account-compromise indicator and escalated immediately.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 57.84 139.36 cm
q
.121569 .305882 .47451 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 3 Tm /F2 12 Tf 15 TL (4. Laptop and application troubleshooting) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
