BT 1 0 0 1 0 15.2 Tm /F1 8.8 Tf 12 TL (Confirm that the operating system and approved application are up to date. Do not install updates from pop-ups, third-party) Tj T* (download sites, or links in unsolicited messages.) Tj T* ET
